<section class="wet-team-respect{% if with_comments %} wet-team-respect--with-comments{% endif %}{% if teaser %} wet-team-respect--teaser{% endif %}" aria-labelledby="{{ heading_id }}" data-wet-reveal>
  <div class="wet-team-respect__art" aria-hidden="true">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 180 180">
      <circle cx="90" cy="90" r="70" opacity=".28"/>
      <path d="M36 93 68 61c7-7 17-7 24 0l8 8M144 93l-32-32c-7-7-17-7-24 0L66 83c-5 5-5 13 0 18s13 5 18 0l16-16M43 100l33 33c5 5 13 5 18 0l4-4M137 100l-32 33c-5 5-13 5-18 0L65 111M100 85l24 24M89 96l24 24M77 107l23 23"/>
      <path class="wet-team-respect__accent" d="M30 47c18-19 41-29 67-29M22 64c11-17 24-29 40-36M150 129c-18 20-42 31-70 32"/>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <div class="wet-team-respect__content">
    <h2 id="{{ heading_id }}">Why respect matters</h2>
    <p>The atmosphere at WET is created by everyone who walks through our doors.</p>
    <p>By respecting personal boundaries, communicating clearly and treating others with courtesy, we help create an environment where everyone can feel comfortable.</p>
    <p>If behaviour affects the comfort or safety of others, our team will step in to help maintain a positive experience for everyone.</p>
  </div>
</section>
